{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_822.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"8afe07f9f268bafc9f0d0bd27e79fe287822a43e41ba0392cc09156b2ac70640","ja":"今日からオレ達『Chrono-Lexica』の\n公演だな！　みんな、がんばろうぜ！","zh":"从今天开始就是我们『Chrono-Lexica』的演出了！大家加油！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_822.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"b48386f196b7fefff6b9d69c7a4714fa9190aa6aa99423ac47bdf4e62d97f3c3","ja":"うん……。でも、昨日の定期公演の時……\n機材が不調だったって……聞いた、よ……。","zh":"嗯……可是，听说昨天的定期公演时……\n设备出故障了……对吧……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_822.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"b4c6d71a3acf958013c433ffbc58ce3cfcbfdc302737238f10771c95fa7ce2f0","ja":"●●●●プロデューサーさんが、対応してるけど……\n時間がかかりそうだから、つなぎが必要そうって……。","zh":"●●●●制作人正在处理，不过……看起来会花点时间，所以好像需要先临时应付一下……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_822.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"aa18f65d2cd4b318b4652cb0357ab3d12105f8ae865030cfd332d50305368390","ja":"つなぎか、そうだなぁ……。\nあっ、みんなでキャッチボールするとか！","zh":"串场吗，这样啊……\n啊！要不要大家一起玩传接球！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_822.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"711a2e613ae7c6317a1bf9971eb0090f2989deb544c2e9ad8659d672351d9459","ja":"それは……ボールのせいで、機材……\nもっと壊れるかも、だから……。","zh":"那是……因为球的缘故，设备……\n可能会坏得更厉害，所以……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_822.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"5685c9526a44c59c803fc6490cbee87cab040f4bb2f836f9ed5d8a6aaef5efbf","ja":"それじゃあ、朗読劇とかはどうかな？\n短くていいなら、私が台本書けるかも……。","zh":"那么，朗读剧之类的怎么样？\n如果短一点就可以的话，说不定我能写剧本……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_822.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"d81f06d35ed5a34b1e52878ba8779ba4b555f2a9dd304c21303aa027d44f9de9","ja":"え……？　そういうのって……いきなり\n書こうと思って、書けるもの、なの……？","zh":"诶……？　那种东西……是想写就能突然写出来的吗……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_822.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"a29a8008db8679bce1b660a8848792576a16d67794d010e213240dc76287d632","ja":"まだ時間はあるし、私たちのユニットだもん！\n出来るだけのことはしたいから。","zh":"时间还早，而且这是我们的组合！\n所以想尽可能把能做的都做了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_822.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"8fe84e02f45e007c7d39759a3064e88940069b1e09352a32d41e5328cd62cfbf","ja":"よーし、それじゃ私、さっそく\nノートを取りに行ってくるね！","zh":"好，那我现在就去拿笔记本！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_822.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"903700055fff3b489990d598d9181baedf1fe6c6f5a7436628bc4eb3f937e028","ja":"あ……百合子さん、行っちゃった……。\n大丈夫……かな？","zh":"啊……百合子走掉了……。\n没事……吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_822.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"af8bd2112c6774acce08734b238191f7efd1978bfb422e828f71b07b798eab66","ja":"うーん……さすがに難しそうだと\n思うんだけど……どうかな？","zh":"嗯……我觉得确实有点难……你觉得呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
